# Cloudflare Pages headers. CSP and caching rules come in Phase 5.

# Cross-origin isolation: lets onnxruntime run the model on several threads
# (10 000 characters in about 1.4 s instead of 4.4 s). Skrubba loads nothing
# from other origins, so require-corp blocks nothing.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp

# Browsers check this file for updates on every visit. It must never be
# cached, or new deploys and the kill switch stop reaching visitors.
/sw.js
  Cache-Control: no-cache
